            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode agar fungsi bekerja seperti yang diharapkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"typescript.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miriam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Miriam!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name</code>, diikuti oleh <code>:</code>, lalu <code>string</code>, <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
